---
title: "What two questions should the charts answer?"
accTitle: "Bank Period Strip questions"
accDescr: "A child-period cashflow answers when money moved; ranked Out bars answer where spending went. Both share bob bank report values."
config:
  layout: dagre
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 18
    nodeSpacing: 28
    wrappingWidth: 210
---
flowchart LR
  REPORT["`**Bank report**<br/>Totals, series, breakdown`"]
  subgraph PANEL["Bank Period Strip"]
    direction TB
    CASH["`**Cashflow**<br/>In up, Out down`"]
    CATS["`**Out by category**<br/>Ranked length bars`"]
  end
  REPORT ==>|"child-period cents"| CASH
  REPORT ==>|"category cents"| CATS
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  class REPORT focus
  class CASH,CATS outcome
  style PANEL fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
